msgstr ""

#: ../../../tutorial/BuildingAJIT4.md:9
msgid ""
"Welcome to Chapter 4 of the \"Building an ORC-based JIT in LLVM\" tutorial. "
"This chapter introduces custom MaterializationUnits and Layers, and the lazy "
"reexports API. Together these will be used to replace the "
"CompileOnDemandLayer from [Chapter 3](BuildingAJIT3.md) with a custom lazy-"
"JITing scheme that JITs directly from Kaleidoscope ASTs."
msgstr ""

